==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~12 seconds<sup>60f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~12 seconds<sup>60f~360f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~12 seconds<sup>60f~360f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.
*When the base reaches 60% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~4 seconds<sup>30f~120f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Very easy stage. The player can use [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]], some meatshields, and some [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] to kill the Mooth.

